      en: ["June 30, 1793, was the date of the official inauguration.", "1792 saw the building constructed in just six months.", "José da Costa e Silva was the leading architect for the project.", "1,148 seats are available in the horseshoe-shaped hall.", "1928 was the year the theater became a national monument.", "The Portuguese Symphonic Orchestra is based at this theater."],
